  "raw_html": "<div class=\"content-area\" id=\"primary\">\n<main class=\"site-main\" id=\"main\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-b39c368c\">\n<h1 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-e52a0102 gb-headline-text\">RSSB Junior Technical Assistant JTA Final Result 2026</h1>\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-659bd175\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-a344b6f7\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-31d42cf5\">\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c57ae0af gb-headline-text\">Post Date: <time class=\"entry-date published\" datetime=\"2026-08-13T16:10:08+05:30\">August 13, 2026</time></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<span class=\"custom-post-time\">4:10 pm</span>\n</div>\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-550ae316 short_Details gb-headline-text\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><a href=\"https://rsmssb.rajasthan.gov.in/\">Rajasthan Staff Selection Board (RSSB)</a>,</strong> has released the<strong> Final Result</strong>\u00a0on its\u00a0<strong>official website</strong> for the Recruitment of <strong>Account Assistant (AA) Examination 2025</strong>. The exam was conducted in<strong> 16 June 2025</strong>, and the last date to submit the application form was\u00a0<strong data-end=\"250\" data-start=\"230\">06 February 2025</strong>. Candidates can check their\u00a0<strong>Final Result </strong>using their\u00a0<strong data-end=\"362\" data-start=\"302\">Enrollment Number, Registration Number, or Date of Birth</strong>\u00a0by logging into the <strong>portal. The direct link</strong> is provided below.</span></p>\n</p>\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-9849916c\">\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p><style>\n        .social-buttons {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 10px;\n        }\n        .social-button {\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            padding: 10px 20px;\n            border-radius: 5px;\n            text-decoration: none;\n            color: wh